sequence-diagram

typeface clean
styleMode shadow
colorMode pastel
autoNumber on

Customer [icon: user] > Checkout [label: "Checkout & Orders"]: Submit checkout + Idempotency-Key
Checkout > Database [icon: aws-rds, label: "PostgreSQL"]: Create order=PENDING_PAYMENT
Checkout > Payment [label: "Payment Provider"]: Create payment
Payment --> Checkout: Timeout / connection lost
Checkout > Database: Mark payment=UNKNOWN
Checkout --> Customer: Processing / do not create a second charge

Payment > Callback [label: "Payment Callback Endpoint"]: Provider webhook with provider transaction id
Callback > Database: Lookup order + deduplicate callback
Database --> Callback: Current payment state
Callback > Database: Transaction: set PAID + outbox event
Database --> Callback: Commit

Reconciler [label: "Payment Reconciliation Worker"] > Database: Find stale UNKNOWN payments
Reconciler > Payment: Query provider by merchant reference
Payment --> Reconciler: Authoritative payment status
Reconciler > Database: Idempotent state transition / compensate if needed

Customer > Checkout: Retry same Idempotency-Key
Checkout > Database: Return existing order/payment state
Database --> Checkout: Existing result
Checkout --> Customer: Same order; never duplicate charge/order
